{"id": "31cc5c27-cf29-43f8-994d-bc4cc5720df6", "slug": "mentorfy-infinite-transformation-1", "title": "Mentorfy - Infinite Transformation", "description": "Mentorfy Infinite Card Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Mentorfy - Infinite Transformation\"\ndescription: \"Mentorfy Infinite Card Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#6366F1\"\n  secondary: \"#05050A\"\n  accent: \"#4F46E5\"\n  background: \"#05050A\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Playfair Display\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Mentorfy - Infinite Transformation\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 214; favorites: 7; remixes: 3.\nTags: card, animated, webgl, threejs, action, effect.\n## Overview\nMentorfy Infinite Card Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nFrom the ancient traditions of mentorship to the frontiers of AI, we carry wisdom across time—so transformation can scale to billions. Mentorfy +2.000 Helped Students +12.5% from Last Month Join the Awakening Enter the…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: From the ancient traditions of mentorship to the frontiers of AI, we carry wisdom across time—so transformation can scale to billions.; +2.000; Infinite Memory. Infinite Transformation.; Infinite Memory; Mentorship Remembered. Transformation at Scale.; Not everyone is ready. But those who are, awaken..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #6366F1, secondary #05050A, accent #4F46E5, background #05050A, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Playfair Display for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"scroll-smooth\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Mentorfy - Infinite Transformation</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"antialiased font-['Inter',sans-serif] bg-[#05050A] text-[#FFFFFF] overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[#6366F1] selection:text-white min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center py-6 sm:py-12 px-4 sm:px-8\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 0px, rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 12px);\">\n\n    <!-- Reusable Logo SVG -->\n    <svg id=\"logo-template\" class=\"hidden\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <path d=\"M12 10.5L13.5 12L12 13.5L10.5 12L12 10.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n        <path d=\"M12 2L14 8H10L12 2Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n        <path d=\"M12 22L14 16H10L12 22Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n        <path d=\"M2 12L8 10V14L2 12Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n        <path d=\"M22 12L16 10V14L22 12Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n    </svg>\n\n    <main class=\"w-full max-w-[1400px] grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 relative z-10\">\n\n        <!-- SECTION 1: Hero (Col Span 2) -->\n        <section class=\"lg:col-span-2 relative p-[1px] rounded-sm bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-transparent group\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"w-full h-full min-h-[500px] bg-[#05050A] relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 border border-white/5\">\n                <canvas id=\"webgl-hero\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0\"></canvas>\n\n                <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center text-center\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-10 h-10 text-[#6366F1] mb-12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#logo-template\"></use></svg>\n\n                    <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-gray-200 gs-reveal font-['Space_Grotesk',sans-serif]\">\n                        From the ancient traditions of mentorship to the frontiers of AI, we carry <span class=\"text-[#6366F1] font-['Space_Grotesk',sans-serif]\">wisdom</span> across time—so transformation can scale to billions.\n                    </h1>\n\n                    <div class=\"mt-16 text-sm font-medium tracking-tight text-white/80 font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">\n                        Mentorfy\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- SECTION 2: Stats & CTA -->\n        <section class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-sm bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-transparent\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#090A0C] border border-white/5 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden\">\n                <div class=\"h-24 w-full opacity-50\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(to right, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3) 0px, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 6px);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 text-center -mt-8\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-5xl sm:text-7xl tracking-tight text-[#6366F1] mb-2 gs-reveal font-['Space_Grotesk',sans-serif]\">+2.000</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white mb-1 font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Helped Students</p>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mb-8 font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">+12.5% from Last Month</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-3\">\n                        <button class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-white text-black text-xs font-medium hover:bg-gray-200 transition-colors font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Join the Awakening</button>\n                        <button class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-[#6366F1] text-white text-xs font-medium hover:bg-[#4F46E5] transition-colors font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Enter the Circle</button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- SECTION 3: Light Feature Card -->\n        <section class=\"relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-black/20 -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-black/20 translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-black/20 -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-black/20 translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"w-full h-full min-h-[450px] bg-[#F7F7F8] text-[#05050A] border border-black/5 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-[0_2.8px_2.2px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.034),_0_6.7px_5.3px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.048),_0_12.5px_10px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.06),_0_22.3px_17.9px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.072),_0_41.8px_33.4px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.086),_0_100px_80px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.12)]\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 0px, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 12px);\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6366F1] text-white text-xs font-medium font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Section 01</span>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-black\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#logo-template\"></use></svg>\n                        <span class=\"text-lg tracking-tight font-medium font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Mentorfy</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"mt-20\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl tracking-tight leading-snug mb-4 gs-reveal font-['Playfair_Display',serif]\">Infinite Memory.<br>Infinite Transformation.</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 max-w-[280px] leading-relaxed mb-8 font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Where ancient wisdom meets AI to awaken potential and scale transformation for a billion lives.</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-[#6366F1] text-white text-xs font-medium font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Memory</span>\n                        <span class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-black/20 text-black text-xs font-medium font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Wisdom</span>\n                        <span class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-black/10 text-black text-xs font-medium font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Awakening</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- SECTION 4: Dark Abstract Feature -->\n        <section class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-sm bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-transparent\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"w-full h-full min-h-[450px] bg-[#05050A] border border-white/5 p-8 flex flex-col justify-end relative overflow-hidden\">\n                <canvas id=\"webgl-abstract\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0\"></canvas>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#05050A] via-[#05050A]/80 to-transparent z-10\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"relative z-20\">\n                    <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-white/30 flex items-center justify-center text-xs text-white mb-4 font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">02</div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl tracking-tight mb-3 gs-reveal font-['Playfair_Display',serif]\">Infinite Memory</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 max-w-sm leading-relaxed font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Where humans forget, Mentorfy remembers.<br>Every detail, every context, every step of the journey remains alive, ensuring seamless and personalized mentorship.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- SECTION 5: Values List -->\n        <section class=\"relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"w-full h-full min-h-[450px] bg-[#6366F1] text-white border border-white/10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 text-center relative overflow-hidden\">\n                <!-- Decorative concentric circles -->\n                <div class=\"absolute w-[150%] aspect-square border border-white/10 rounded-full top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute w-[100%] aspect-square border border-white/10 rounded-full top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"relative z-10 space-y-3 text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tight\">\n                    <p class=\"font-light opacity-70 font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Infinite Memory</p>\n                    <p class=\"font-light opacity-70 font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Timeless Wisdom</p>\n                    <p class=\"font-medium gs-reveal font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Awakened Consciousness</p>\n                    <p class=\"font-light opacity-70 font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Sacred Exclusivity</p>\n                    <p class=\"font-light opacity-70 font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Purposeful Scale</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- SECTION 6: Testimonial/Social -->\n        <section class=\"relative md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-black/20 -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-black/20 translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-black/20 -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-black/20 translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"w-full h-full min-h-[300px] bg-[#F7F7F8] text-[#05050A] border border-black/5 p-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)]\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 0px, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 12px);\">\n                <svg class=\"w-8 h-8 text-black mb-8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#logo-template\"></use></svg>\n\n                <div class=\"flex -space-x-3 mb-4\">\n                    <img class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-white object-cover grayscale\" src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/46ceb0ec-b3fa-4f16-8a70-bbd217ee77a9_800w.jpg\" alt=\"Avatar\">\n                    <img class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-white object-cover grayscale\" src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/009b1373-14ec-472b-af1a-2cd1e8f97116_320w.jpg\" alt=\"Avatar\">\n                    <img class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-white object-cover grayscale\" src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/eca707cc-a5b7-439a-b4fd-247f6106c2e1_320w.jpg\" alt=\"Avatar\">\n                    <img class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-white object-cover grayscale\" src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/b3738db4-e122-4f81-a199-9ae2536b9357_320w.jpg\" alt=\"Avatar\">\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex gap-1 mb-6 text-[#6366F1]\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-broken\" width=\"14\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5px\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-broken\" width=\"14\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5px\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-broken\" width=\"14\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5px\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-broken\" width=\"14\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5px\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-broken\" width=\"14\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5px\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n\n                <h4 class=\"text-lg tracking-tight font-medium mb-2 gs-reveal font-['Playfair_Display',serif]\">Mentorship Remembered.<br>Transformation at Scale.</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 max-w-[250px] leading-relaxed uppercase tracking-wider font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Across the world, leaders are awakening to a new era of mentorship where every journey is remembered, and every transformation becomes inevitable.</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- SECTION 7: Final CTA Dark -->\n        <section class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-sm bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-transparent lg:col-span-1\">\n             <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"w-full h-full min-h-[300px] bg-[#05050A] border border-white/5 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-12\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-white\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#logo-template\"></use></svg>\n                    <span class=\"text-sm tracking-tight font-medium font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Mentorfy</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tight mb-3 uppercase leading-snug gs-reveal font-['Playfair_Display',serif]\">Not everyone is ready.<br>But those who are, awaken.</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 max-w-xs leading-relaxed font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Mentorfy isn't for everyone. It's for those who understand that mentorship is not information, but transformation.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- SECTION 8: Final CTA Striped Light -->\n        <section class=\"relative lg:col-span-1 shadow-[0_2.8px_2.2px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.034),_0_6.7px_5.3px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.048),_0_12.5px_10px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.06),_0_22.3px_17.9px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.072),_0_41.8px_33.4px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.086),_0_100px_80px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.12)]\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-black/20 -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-black/20 translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-black/20 -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-black/20 translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-20\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"w-full h-full min-h-[300px] bg-white border border-black/5 p-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-end text-center relative overflow-hidden\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(to right, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4) 0px, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 6px);\"></div>\n                <!-- Fade out top and bottom of stripes -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-transparent to-white opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center pb-4\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-16 h-16 text-[#05050A] mb-8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#logo-template\"></use></svg>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl tracking-tight mb-3 uppercase text-[#05050A] gs-reveal font-['Playfair_Display',serif]\">Not everyone is ready.<br>But those who are, awaken.</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 max-w-[250px] leading-relaxed font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Mentorfy isn't for everyone. It's for those who understand that mentorship is not information, but transformation.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // 1. GSAP Masked Reveal Logic\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            const revealElements = document.querySelectorAll(\".gs-reveal\");\n\n            revealElements.forEach((el) => {\n                const text = el.innerHTML;\n                el.innerHTML = \"\";\n\n                // Create a temporary div to parse HTML content (like the indigo span)\n                const tempDiv = document.createElement('div');\n                tempDiv.innerHTML = text;\n\n                const processNode = (node) => {\n                    if (node.nodeType === 3) { // Text node\n                        const words = node.textContent.split(/(\\s+)/); // keep spaces\n                        const fragment = document.createDocumentFragment();\n                        words.forEach(word => {\n                            if (word.trim() === '') {\n                                fragment.appendChild(document.createTextNode(word));\n                            } else {\n                                const wrapper = document.createElement(\"span\");\n                                wrapper.style.display = \"inline-block\";\n                                wrapper.style.overflow = \"hidden\";\n                                wrapper.style.verticalAlign = \"top\";\n\n                                const inner = document.createElement(\"span\");\n                                inner.className = \"mask-word-inner\";\n                                inner.textContent = word;\n                                inner.style.display = \"inline-block\";\n                                inner.style.transform = \"translateY(110%)\";\n                                inner.style.willChange = \"transform\";\n\n                                // Inherit color if parent has it\n                                if(node.parentElement && node.parentElement.classList.contains('text-[#6366F1]')){\n                                     inner.classList.add('text-[#6366F1]');\n                                }\n                                wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                                fragment.appendChild(wrapper);\n                            }\n                        });\n                        return fragment;\n                    } else if (node.nodeType === 1) { // Element node\n                        if(node.style.overflow === 'hidden') return node; // Skip already processed\n                        const clone = node.cloneNode(false);\n                        Array.from(node.childNodes).forEach(child => {\n                            clone.appendChild(processNode(child));\n                        });\n                        return clone;\n                    }\n                };\n\n                Array.from(tempDiv.childNodes).forEach(child => {\n                    el.appendChild(processNode(child));\n                });\n\n                // Animate\n                gsap.to(el.querySelectorAll(\".mask-word-inner\"), {\n                    y: \"0%\",\n                    duration: 0.8,\n                    stagger: 0.03,\n                    ease: \"power3.out\",\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: el,\n                        start: \"top 90%\",\n                    }\n                });\n            });\n\n            // 2. WebGL Background Setup (Three.js minimal implementation)\n            const initWebGL = (canvasId, type) => {\n                const canvas = document.getElementById(canvasId);\n                if (!canvas) return;\n\n                const parent = canvas.parentElement;\n                const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n                renderer.setSize(parent.clientWidth, parent.clientHeight);\n                renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n                const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n                const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, parent.clientWidth / parent.clientHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n                camera.position.z = 5;\n\n                let geometry, material, mesh;\n\n                if (type === 'hero') {\n                    // Soft glowing indigo planes\n                    geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(15, 15, 32, 32);\n                    material = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({\n                        color: 0x6366F1,\n                        wireframe: true,\n                        transparent: true,\n                        opacity: 0.15\n                    });\n                    mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n                    mesh.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 3;\n                    scene.add(mesh);\n                } else if (type === 'abstract') {\n                    // Flowing grey lines simulation\n                    geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(10, 10, 64, 64);\n                    material = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\n                        color: 0xffffff,\n                        wireframe: true,\n                        transparent: true,\n                        opacity: 0.2\n                    });\n                    mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n                    mesh.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 4;\n                    scene.add(mesh);\n\n                    const light = new THREE.PointLight(0xffffff, 1, 100);\n                    light.position.set(0, 0, 5);\n                    scene.add(light);\n                }\n\n                // Animation loop\n                const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n                const animate = function () {\n                    requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                    const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                    if(mesh && geometry) {\n                        mesh.rotation.z = elapsedTime * 0.05;\n\n                        // Simple displacement\n                        const positions = geometry.attributes.position;\n                        for (let i = 0; i < positions.count; i++) {\n                            const vx = positions.getX(i);\n                            const vy = positions.getY(i);\n                            const z = Math.sin(vx * 2 + elapsedTime) * Math.cos(vy * 2 + elapsedTime) * 0.5;\n                            positions.setZ(i, z);\n                        }\n                        positions.needsUpdate = true;\n                    }\n\n                    renderer.render(scene, camera);\n                };\n\n                animate();\n\n                // Handle resize\n                window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                    if(!canvas.parentElement) return;\n                    const width = canvas.parentElement.clientWidth;\n                    const height = canvas.parentElement.clientHeight;\n                    renderer.setSize(width, height);\n                    camera.aspect = width / height;\n                    camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                });\n            };\n\n            initWebGL('webgl-hero', 'hero');\n            initWebGL('webgl-abstract', 'abstract');\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "mentorfy-infinite-transformation-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/mentorfy-infinite-transformation-1.jpg", "source_name": "mentorfy-infinite-transformation-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 294, "forks": 7, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T13:04:08.917502+00:00"}